    "en": {
      "name": "Adamancipator Crystal - Tiamite",
      "effect": "If this card is Special Summoned by an \"Adamancipator\" card's effect: You can add 1 \"Adamancipator\" card from your Deck to your hand, except \"Adamancipator Crystal - Tiamite\", then you can Special Summon 1 Rock monster from your hand. If this card is in your GY: You can target 1 Rock Synchro Monster in your field or GY; return it to the Extra Deck, and if you do, place this card on top of the Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Adamancipator Crystal - Tiamite\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
